<!DOCTYPE html><!-- SYNTHETIC FIXTURE: copies the Lovtidend avd. I document shape; no Lovdata text. --><html lang="no"><head><title>Lov om prøving (prøveloven)</title><base href="https://lovdata.no/" /></head><body><header class="documentHeader" id="hode"><dl class="data-document-key-info"><dt class="legacyID">Datokode</dt><dd class="legacyID">LOV-2019-06-14-99</dd><dt class="dokid">DokumentID</dt><dd class="dokid">LTI/lov/2019-06-14-99</dd><dt class="dateInForce">I kraft fra</dt><dd class="dateInForce">Kongen bestemmer</dd><dt class="changesToDocuments">Endrer</dt><dd class="changesToDocuments"><ul><li>lov/1930-02-21</li></ul></dd><dt class="dateOfPublication">Kunngjort</dt><dd class="dateOfPublication">2019-06-14 14:00</dd><dt class="title">Tittel</dt><dd class="title">Lov om prøving (prøveloven)</dd><dt class="refid">RefID</dt><dd class="refid">lov/2019-06-14-99</dd></dl></header><main class="documentBody" data-lovdata-URL="LTI/lov/2019-06-14-99" id="dokument"><h1>Lov om prøving (prøveloven)</h1><section class="section" data-name="kap1" id="kapittel-1"><h2>Kapittel 1. Innledning</h2><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§1" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 1</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Virkeområde</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1-ledd-1">Loven gjelder prøving av fylkesmannen. Den gjelder også retting.</article><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1-ledd-2">Annet ledd første punktum. Annet ledd annet punktum.</article></article><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§2" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 2</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Liste</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1">Følgende gjelder:<ul class="defaultList"><li data-li-identifier="a)" data-name="a)"><article class="listArticle" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-1"><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-1-ledd-1">bokstav a</article></article></li><li data-li-identifier="b)" data-name="b)"><article class="listArticle" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-2"><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-2-ledd-1">bokstav b</article></article></li></ul></article><article class="defaultP">Bokstav b gjelder ikke private.</article></article></section><section class="section" data-name="kap2" id="kapittel-2"><h2>Kapittel 2. Slutt</h2><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§3" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-1"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 3</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Ikrafttredelse</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-1-ledd-1">Loven gjelder fra den tid Kongen bestemmer.</article></article><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§4" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-2"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 4</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Gammel</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-2-ledd-1">Denne paragrafen oppheves senere.</article></article></section></main></body></html>
